1432
01:37:48,963 --> 01:37:50,130
Vamos lá.

1433
01:37:59,515 --> 01:38:01,057
Papai?

1434
01:38:03,227 --> 01:38:04,562
Papai!

1435
01:38:15,614 --> 01:38:16,615
Papai.

1436
01:38:18,492 --> 01:38:20,035
Papai.

1437
01:38:22,121 --> 01:38:24,122
Onde está meu filho?

1438
01:38:24,123 --> 01:38:27,167
